{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45701","headline":"甘雨应祈 · 贯休","name":"甘雨应祈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雨偶愆期，草木亦未觉。\n君侯不遑处，退食或闭阁。\n东海浪滔滔，西江波漠漠。\n得不愿身爲大虬，金其角，玉其甲。\n一吸再喢，云平雾匝。\n华畅九有，清倾六合。\n使不苏者苏，不足者足。\n情通上玄，如膏绵绵。\n有叟有叟，鼓腹歌於道边。\n歌曰：麦苗芃芃兮鶬鶊飞，日出而作兮日入归，如彼草木兮雨露肥。\n古人三乐兮，我乐多之。\n天之成兮，地之平兮。\n柘系黄兮，瓠叶青兮。\n乳女啼兮，蒸黍馨兮。\n炙背扪虱兮，复何经营兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}